      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "hint": "desktop-experience-heading",
      "text": "The home page was rebuilt after launch. A fixed hero image gave way to an endless tiled plane of the complex — one tile per facility — that the visitor pulls around with the cursor. Exploration happens before a single line of copy is read, and the brand line rides over it."
